<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina indicators calendar for next 3 months.</title>
<headline>Argentina indicators calendar for next 3 months.</headline>
<text>
<p>INDICATOR			NOVEMBER     DECEMBER	JANUARY</p>
<p>Tax revenue			 -	  2 approx (Nov) 2 approx</p>
<p>Fiscal balance		    -	  2 approx (Nov) 2 approx</p>
<p>Consumer price index	    -	  3 (Nov)	  3 approx</p>
<p>Wholesale price index	   -	  3 (Nov)	  3 approx</p>
<p>Industrial production (FIEL) 25 (Oct) 15 approx (Nov)15 approx</p>
<p>Industrial production (Govt) 29 (Oct) 30 (Nov)	 30 approx</p>
<p>Trade balance		     -	  5 (Oct)	  6 approx</p>
<p>Unemployment		     n/a	18 (Oct)	    n/a</p>
<p>Supermarket sales		 -	 19 (Oct)	 20 approx</p>
<p>- already released</p>
<p>-- Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0668</p>
</text>
